",\"glanceSeeInTierList\":\"See {name} in full tier list\",\"glanceAriaLabel\":\"Hero at-a-glance stats and attributes\",\"glanceTrendSr\":\"{metric} change over the last {days} days\",\"attrDurability\":\"Durability\",\"attrOffense\":\"Offense\",\"attrControl\":\"Control\",\"attrDifficulty\":\"Difficulty\",\"bsCuratedBuild\":\"Curated Build\",\"bsRecommendedBuild\":\"Recommended Build\",\"bsDefaultPath\":\"Default Path\",\"bsCoreItems\":\"Core Items\",\"bsSpellLabel\":\"Spell\",\"bsSeeAll\":\"See all\",\"bsSeeAllHeroAria\":\"See all {name} builds\",\"bsSeeAllAria\":\"See all builds\",\"bsLegacyOld\":\"Old\",\"bgReviewed\":\"Reviewed {date}\",\"bgOlderPatchLabel\":\"Older patch\",\"bgStalePatchTooltip\":\"These loadouts were last re-read on patch {patch}; the live patch is {current}. Item stats may have changed.\",\"bgHeadingBuilds\":\"Best Builds, Emblems\",\"bgHeadingTalents\":\"Talents\",\"bgSubtitle\":\"Three battle-tested loadouts. Pick the one that fits the draft, not the one with the most flash.\",\"bgSets\":\"{count} Sets\",\"bgCost\":\"Cost\",\"bgEmblemSetup\":\"Emblem Setup\",\"bgEmblemLabel\":\"Emblem\",\"bgBattleSpell\":\"Battle Spell\",\"bgBattleSpellAlt\":\"Battle Spell: {spell}\",\"bgBlessingLabel\":\"Blessing\",\"bgSituationalSwaps\":\"Situational Swaps\",\"bgOver\":\"over\",\"bgPassiveConflict\":\"Passive Conflict\",\"bgConflictOn\":\"on\",\"bgCuratedPending\":\"Curated Builds Pending\",\"bgLoadouts\":\"Loadouts\",\"bgPendingDesc\":\"This hero does not have a curated build review yet. Use the build simulator to test a six-item path while this page waits for a dedicated build pass.\",\"bgOpenSimulator\":\"Open Build Simulator\",\"bgSimulator\":\"Simulator\",\"bgFallbackBuilds\":\"Fallback Builds\",\"bgFallbackDesc\":\"Curated builds are not reviewed for this hero yet. These legacy sets remain available during migration.\",\"bgBuildSet\":\"Build Set\",\"bgCore\":\"Core\",\"bgItemPath\":\"Item Path\",\"bgSlots\":\"6 slots\",\"bgBrowseItems\":\"Browse all items\",\"bgViewEmblems\":\"View all emblems\",\"bgExploreSpells\":\"Explore battle spells\",\"csCounterPicks\":\"Counter Picks\",\"csSeeAll\":\"See all\",\"csWeakAgainst\":\"Weak Against\",\"csStrongAgainst\":\"Strong Against\",\"csFullCounterGuide\":\"Full {name} counter guide\",\"qcSeeAll\":\"See all\",\"ctOfficialAllyNote\":\"Official Ally Note\",\"ctOfficialCounterNote\":\"Official Counter Note\",\"ctOfficialThreatNote\":\"Official Threat Note\",\"ctWinRateDelta\":\"win rate delta\",\"ctViewAll\":\"View all\",\"ctStatWeakTo\":\"Weak To\",\"ctStatPeakPhase\":\"Peak Phase\",\"ctStatCounters\":\"Counters\",\"ctTopCounter\":\"Top Counter\",\"ctOpenCounterPageAria\":\"Open full counter page for {name}\",\"ctPhaseBalanced\":\"Balanced\",\"ctPhaseEarlyShort\":\"Early\",\"ctPhaseMidShort\":\"Mid\",\"ctPhaseLateShort\":\"Late\",\"ctPhaseEarlyLabel\":\"Early Game\",\"ctPhaseMidLabel\":\"Mid Game\",\"ctPhaseLateLabel\":\"Late Game\",\"ctPhaseEarlySub\":\"0-10 min\",\"ctPhaseMidSub\":\"10-16 min\",\"ctPhaseLateSub\":\"16+ min\",\"ctPhaseTextEarly\":\"{name} is strongest in the early game: across the {count} matchups measured for them, {name} does best before the 10-minute mark and falls off as matches run long. Avoid early skirmishes and punish {name} once the game opens up.\",\"ctPhaseTextMid\":\"{name} peaks in the mid game, between 10 and 16 minutes, across the {count} matchups measured for them. The early and late phases are where {name} is easiest to punish, so shut them down before the mid game or outscale them after it.\",\"ctPhaseTextLate\":\"{name} scales into the late game: across the {count} matchups measured for them, {name} does best once matches pass 16 minutes. Build your lead in the first 10 minutes before {name} reaches full power.\",\"ctPhaseTextBalanced\":\"{name}'s {count} measured matchups do not separate by match length: no phase leads the others by more than that sample can resolve. There is no single window where {name} drops off, so focus on consistent play and team coordination.\",\"ctHowToCounterTitle\":\"How to Counter\",\"ctHowToCounterDesc\":\"These heroes have the biggest measured edge against {name} in ranked matches. Pick any of them for a statistical advantage in draft.\",\"ctBeatsTitle\":\"Heroes {name}\",\"ctBeatsHighlight\":\"Counters\",\"ctBeatsDesc\":\"{name} performs well against these heroes. Consider picking {name} when you see them on the enemy team.\",\"ctGamePhaseTitle\":\"Game Phase Analysis for\",\"ctUnavailable\":\"Counter data unavailable for {name}.\",\"ctPhaseVulnerable\":\"{name} dips here\",\"ctPhaseStrong\":\"{name} peaks here\",\"ctPhaseMiddle\":\"In between\",\"ctPhaseEven\":\"No measured separation\",\"ctPhaseSampleNote\":\"Shape only, from the {count} matchups measured for {name}. The bars rank {name}'s own phases against each other, not against other heroes, and are not win rates.\",\"skillsUnavailable\":\"Skill data unavailable for {name}.\",\"svSkillsAria\":\"Hero skills\",\"svDemoUnavailable\":\"Demo unavailable\",\"svLoadingDemo\":\"Loading demo\",\"svPlayDemoAria\":\"Play {skill} demo\",\"svSkillUpgradePriority\":\"Skill Upgrade Priority\",\"svSkillOrderNote\":\"Skill Order Note\",\"svRecommendedCombo\":\"Recommended Combo\",\"svComboGuide\":\"Combo Guide\",\"svTypePassive\":\"Passive\",\"svTypeSkill1\":\"Skill 1\",\"svTypeSkill2\":\"Skill 2\",\"svTypeSkill3\":\"Skill 3\",\"svTypeUltimate\":\"Ultimate\",\"svTypeShortS1\":\"S1\",\"svTypeShortS2\":\"S2\",\"svTypeShortS3\":\"S3\",\"svSkillIconAlt\":\"{hero} {type} - {skill}\",\"cbComingSoon\":\"Combo data for {name} is coming soon.\",\"cbSkillCombosFor\":\"Skill Combos for\",\"cbSkillCombosDesc\":\"Recommended skill sequences for teamfights and laning phase.\",\"ssComingSoon\":\"Synergy data for {name} is coming soon.\",\"ssBestPartners\":\"Best Partners for\",\"ssBestPartnersDesc\":\"Heroes that synergize well with {name} in team compositions.\",\"ssStrongAgainst\":\"Strong Against\",\"ssWeakAgainst\":\"Weak Against\",\"ssOfficialOnlyNote\":\"These come from Moonton's own lists for {name}, not from measured ranked matches.\",\"ssMeasuredOpposite\":\"Ranked matches show the opposite\",\"skgCodexEmpty\":\"Codex Empty\",\"skgNoRecords\":\"No skin records have been catalogued for {name}.\",\"skgHeroSkins\":\"{name}'s Skins\",\"skgTotal\":\"Total\",\"skgAll\":\"All\",\"skgNoSkinsInTier\":\"No skins in this tier\",\"skgShowAll\":\"Show all {count} skins\",\"skgPriceUnavailable\":\"Price not available\",\"skgFilterAria\":\"Filter skins by rarity tier\",\"skgBattlePointsTitle\":\"{count} Battle Points\",\"skgDiamondsTitle\":\"{count} Diamonds\",\"bioAboutGuide\":\"About the author of this {name} guide\",\"loreNoBackstory\":\"{name} does not have an inline backstory yet, but the full story is written up in Legends of Dawn.\",\"loreReadFull\":\"Read Full Story in Legends of Dawn\",\"loreUnavailable\":\"Lore unavailable for {name}.\",\"loreLegendOf\":\"The Legend of {name}\",\"loreAllies\":\"Allies\",\"loreRivals\":\"Rivals\",\"trendHeading\":\"{name} Trend\",\"trendHeadingRange\":\"{name} Trend ({range})\",\"trendNoDataZero\":\"Not enough snapshots collected yet. Daily stats are archived automatically; check back after the next refresh.\",\"trendNoDataOne\":\"Only one snapshot collected so far. The trend chart renders once a second daily snapshot is captured.\",\"relHeading\":\"Related Heroes\",\"relSameRole\":\"Same Role\",\"relCounters\":\"Counters {name}\",\"relLane\":\"{lane} Lane\",\"relBrowseAll\":\"Browse All Heroes\",\"relReasonRole\":\"{role} • {wr}% WR\",\"relReasonLane\":\"{lane} Lane • {wr}% WR\",\"relReasonCounter\":\"+{pp} pp vs {name}\",\"portraitAlt\":\"{name} - {title}, Mobile Legends {roles} hero\",\"rankStatsH2\":\"{name} Win Rate \u0026 Pick Rate by Rank\",\"rankStatsIntro\":\"{name}’s performance varies across MLBB ranked brackets. The table compares {name}’s current win rate, pick rate, and ban rate at each rank against the hero’s all-rank baseline and tracks the change over the last {days} days. Stats last refreshed {updated}.\",\"rankColMetric\":\"Metric\",\"rankColDelta\":\"Δ vs All Ranks\",\"rankColTrend\":\"{days}-Day Trend\",\"rankTierListLink\":\"{rank} Tier List\",\"rankCardH3\":\"{name} Win Rate in {rank}\",\"rankSentenceLead\":\"At {rank} rank, {name} holds a \",\"rankSentenceMid1\":\" win rate ({delta} vs all-rank average), is picked in \",\"rankSentenceMid2\":\" of games, and banned in \",\"rankSentenceAfter\":\" of {rank} drafts.\",\"rankLabelWinRate\":\"Win Rate\",\"rankLabelPickRate\":\"Pick Rate\",\"rankLabelBanRate\":\"Ban Rate\",\"faqHeading\":\"{name} FAQ\",\"faqConjunction\":\"and\",\"faqLeadWithLane\":\"{name} is {article} {role} hero played {laneProse}.\",\"faqLeadNoLane\":\"{name} is {article} {role} hero.\",\"faqLeadBuildBefore\":\" Its strongest build centers on {cores}; open the \",\"faqLeadBuildSimLink\":\"{name} build simulator\",\"faqLeadBuildMid\":\" for the full item order and final stats, or compare every available loadout on the \",\"faqLeadBuildsLink\":\"{name} builds page\",\"faqLeadBuildAfter\":\". \",\"faqLeadNoBuildBefore\":\" Compare every available loadout on the \",\"faqLeadCounterBefore\":\"See every hero that beats it on the \",\"faqLeadCounterLink\":\"{name} counter page\",\"faqLeadCounterAfter\":\".\",\"faqBuildQ\":\"What is the best {name} build in {year}?\",\"faqBuildA\":\"{name}'s strongest build centers on {cores} as core items, paired with the {emblem} and the {spell} battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page.\",\"faqEmblemQ\":\"What is the best emblem for {name}?\",\"faqEmblemA\":\"The recommended emblem for {name} is {emblem}, set up with the {talents} talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section.\",\"faqRoleQ\":\"What lane and role is {name} in Mobile Legends?\",\"faqRoleAWithLane\":\"{name} is {article} {role} hero, usually played {laneProse}. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.\",\"faqRoleANoLane\":\"{name} is {article} {role} hero. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.\",\"faqCountersQ\":\"Who counters {name}?\",\"faqCountersA\":\"{name} is countered most by {counters}, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against {name} in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes {name} beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section.\",\"faqDifficultyQ\":\"Is {name} hard to play?\",\"faqDifficultyA\":\"{name} is rated {difficulty} difficulty in Mobile Legends. {advice}\",\"faqDifficultyAdviceEasy\":\"The kit is forgiving, which makes {name} a reliable pick for players still learning the role.\",\"faqDifficultyAdviceHard\":\"{name} has a higher skill floor, so expect a learning curve on combos and positioning before the hero pays off.\",\"faqDifficultyAdviceMedium\":\"{name} rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players.\",\"faqWinrateQ\":\"What is {name}'s win rate this patch?\",\"faqWinrateA\":\"{name} currently holds a {wr}% win rate, a {pr}% pick rate, and a {br}% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section.\",\"faqWinrateANoRanks\":\"{name} currently holds a {wr}% win rate, a {pr}% pick rate, and a {br}% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data.\"}},\"children\":\"$L30\"}]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[\"$L31\",[[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/19orrxyyc0nsx.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-1\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xo05gorf38-h.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$19\",null,{\"name\":\