,060 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Inspire Duelist build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-inspire-duelist\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Inspire Duelist build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-inspire-duelist\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}31:[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$5c\"}}]],[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://mlbbhub.com\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Heroes\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Freya\\\"}]}\"}}]],[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$5d\"}}],\"$L5e\",\"$L5f\"],\"$L60\",\"$L61\"]\n1a:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MLBB Freya Build, Guide, Emblem \u0026 Counter (2026)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Freya build, counter, and strategy guide for MLBB patch 2.1.95. Sacred Orb management, Valkyrie power spikes, why Phoveus destroys her, and two build paths.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"mlbb heroes,ml heroes,ml heroes name list with p