chase Endless Battle (2,330 gold) as item 4 in the Jungle Tempo Cleanup build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-jungle-tempo-cleanup\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Gun\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Gun (2,120 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle Tempo Cleanup build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-jungle-tempo-cleanup\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Sea Halberd\",\"text\":\"Purchase Sea Halberd (2,050 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Tempo Cleanup build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-jungle-tempo-cleanup\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T903,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Freya in Mobile Legends: EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser\",\"description\":\"Defensive EXP setup for drafts where Freya must enter second, absorb the first burst window, and keep fighting through Valkyrie healing.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Vengeance Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-anti-burst-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Corrosion Scythe\",\"text\":\"Purchase Corrosion Scythe (2,050 gold) as item 2 in the EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-anti-burst-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 3 in the EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-anti-burst-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Queen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-anti-burst-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-anti-burst-bruiser\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Anti-Burst Bruiser build for Freya.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya#build-exp-anti-burst-bruiser\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/freya\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Freya\",\"slug\":\"freya\",\"title\":\"Valkyrie\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\",\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":60,\"offense\":70,\"controlEffect\":60,\"difficulty\":40},\"winRate\":48.11,\"pickRate\":0.7,\"banRate\":1.78,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"lesley\",\"heroName\":\"Lesley\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Freya not only has exceptional mobility, she also excels in prolonged engagements, making her highly effective against fragile, low-HP Marksmen, such as Lesley and Ixia. Her excellent sustained damage and mobility also allows her to counter Tanks with low damage, like Uranus and Baxia.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"ixia\",\"heroName\":\"Ixia\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Freya not only has exceptional mobility, she also excels in prolonged engagements, making her highly effective against fragile, low-HP Marksmen, such as Lesley and Ixia. Her excellent sustained damage and mobility also allows her to counter Tanks with low damage, like Uranus and Baxia.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"phoveus\",\"heroName\":\"Phoveus\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"However, all of Freya's skills have movement components, making her vulnerable to Phoveus's unique counter. Using her skills near Phoveus will allow him to quickly gain energy for his enhanced Basic Attacks. Freya is vulnerable to CC and movement-disabling effects, so Minsitthar and Obsidia's Ultimates can lock her down completely.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"obsidia\",\"heroName\":\"Obsidia\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"However, all of Freya's skills have movement components, making her vulnerable to Phoveus's unique counter. Using her skills near Phoveus will allow him to quickly gain energy for his enhanced Basic Attacks. Freya is vulnerable to CC and movement-disabling effects, so Minsitthar and Obsidia's Ultimates can lock her down completely.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/71d910744206adec64f7c5e97b0698c7.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b9c34c88762ca8e66ccd4d84071bf0bc.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"If she manages to land her ult on a bunch of enemy heroes piled up in one spot, Freya will be able to jump in freely without any hindrance, making the enemy team locked in consecutive crowd controls which will render them useless with no means of fighting back ensuring a successful team fight.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"7\",\"heroName\":\"Alucard\",\"heroSlug\":\"alucard\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_2f53289ddd423fa9bc95d380b6d79719.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Fighters who don't have enough crowd control to win a 1v1 situation. Even if alucard has insane lifesteal, Freya is strong enough to kill him because she can dish as much damage while stunning him every few seconds.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"24\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_50b8723a3ca11dd18d34d26948aef12b.png\",\"tip\":\"Freya relies heavily on her basic attacks to make the damage and Natalia's silence + smoke bomb if done correctly will make Freya unable to deal damage onto her.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Power of Einherjar\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Freya gains 1 Sacred Orb with each Basic Attack (up to 6 Sacred Orbs). Consuming 1 Sacred Orb grants Freya 100% Attack Speed for her next Basic Attack (up to 6 stacks).\\n\\nWhile out of combat, Sacred Orbs regenerate gradually.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Freya gains 1 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sacred Orb\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" with each Basic Attack (up to 6 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sacred Orbs\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"). Consuming 1 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sacred Orb\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" grants Freya 100% Attack Speed for her next Basic Attack (up to 6 stacks).\\n\\nWhile out of combat, \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sacred Orbs\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" regenerate gradually.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dcd7beb4c0cef38f848a6cf26e51b105.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Leap of Faith\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Freya leaps to the target area and strikes the ground with her shield, gaining 500 (+100% Total Physical Attack) shield and dealing 200 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within while knocking them airborne for 0.4s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Freya leaps to the target area and strikes the ground with her shield, gaining 500\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" shield and dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies within while knocking them airborne for 0.4s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"8s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2350b4a4d8b8526e9e19c4daba69155.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Shield\"]},{\"name\":\"Valkyrie Slash\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Freya charges forward and slashes, dealing 150 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing enemies by 30% for 0.5s.\\nThis skill has no base cooldown but consumes 2 Sacred Orbs per cast.\\nIt deals 50% damage to creeps.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Freya charges forward and slashes, dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and slowing enemies by 30% for 0.5s.\\nThis skill has no base cooldown but consumes 2 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sacred Orbs\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" per cast.\\nIt deals 50% damage to creeps.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"0.396s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e14d289ed1917b89945f8d502c05d9c6.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Valkyrie Descent\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Freya selects a target area and dives down as a Sacred Orb (gaining Control Immunity), dealing 300 (+75% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and 40% slow to enemies in her path and at the landing point for 2s. Upon landing, Freya enters the Valkyrie state for 10s, during which her Basic Attacks deal 30 extra damage (extra damage cannot Crit), she recovers 40 (+40% Total Physical Attack) HP per Basic Attack, and her Basic Attacks deal splash damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Freya selects a target area and dives down as a Sacred Orb (gaining Control Immunity), dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+75% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and 40% slow to enemies in her path and at the landing point for 2s. Upon landing, Freya enters the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valkyrie\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state for 10s, during which her Basic Attacks deal 30 extra damage (extra damage cannot Crit), she recovers 40\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" HP per Basic Attack, and her Basic Attacks deal splash damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"44s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_49a8b4de271d0162ab9e26e06819840e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Morph\",\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Learn S1 first at level 1 and level it up as soon as you can. Damage increases with each level and cool down decreases as well.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Learn S1 first at level 1 and level it up as soon as you can. Damage increases with each level and cool down decreases as well.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"belerick\",\"heroName\":\"Belerick\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"In order for Freya to maximize her damage, she prefers heroes with CC like Belerick and Gatotkaca to lock down the enemy for her.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"gatotkaca\",\"heroName\":\"Gatotkaca\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"In order for Freya to maximize her damage, she prefers heroes with CC like Belerick and Gatotkaca to lock down the enemy for her.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use Freya's Ultimate to dive the enemy backline and start dealing Splash Damage. Use her 1st Skill to CC enemies and shield herself, then alternate between her 2nd Skill and AoE Basic Attacks to bring them down.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":2250,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_49a8b4de271d0162ab9e26e06819840e.png\"},{\"skillId\":2299,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2350b4a4d8b8526e9e19c4daba69155.png\"},{\"skillId\":2298,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e14d289ed1917b89945f8d502c05d9c6.png\"},{\"skillId\":2200,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":2298,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e14d289ed1917b89945f8d502c05d9c6.png\"},{\"skillId\":2200,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use Freya's 1st Skill to close the gap on enemies and knock them Airborne while giving herself a shield. Use her 2nd Skill once followed by 2 enhanced Basic Attacks to make use of the Attack Speed bonus and generate more Sacred Orbs from her Passive.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":2299,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2350b4a4d8b8526e9e19c4daba69155.png\"},{\"skillId\":2298,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e14d289ed1917b89945f8d502c05d9c6.png\"},{\"skillId\":2200,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":2298,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e14d289ed1917b89945f8d502c05d9c6.png\"},{\"skillId\":2200,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Freya build, counter, and strategy guide for MLBB patch 2.1.95. Sacred Orb management, Valkyrie power spikes, why Phoveus destroys her, and two build paths.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Freya after the November 2025 rework is a different hero. The 6 Sacred Orb system turned her from a \\\"spam skills for attack speed\\\" duelist into a resource manager: stock orbs before the fight, burn them during Valkyrie state, run dry and you are a melee bruiser with no escape. Patch 2.1.88 shortened the Valkyrie window from 12 to 10 seconds and raised the cooldown, so the cost of wasting orbs or mistiming the dive is higher than ever ([patch notes](/patch-notes)).\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"freya\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-inspire-duelist\",\"name\":\"EXP Inspire Duelist\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\",\"cost\":2390,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\",\"cost\":2330,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\",\"cost\":2060,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\"},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\"},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"fatal\",\"name\":\"Fatal\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/fatal.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"war-cry\",\"name\":\"War Cry\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/war-cry.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"inspire\",\"name\":\"Inspire\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"great-dragon-spear\",\"name\":\"Great Dragon Spear\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when enemy armor is low and you need the post-ultimate movement speed to keep targets inside Valkyrie range.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against shield supports, healing EXP laners, or high-extra-HP frontliners before they finish two defense items.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic burst that hits before Immortality can convert into a useful second life.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP lane setup for winning extended melee trades with Inspire, Corrosion Scythe uptime, and crit-backed basic attacks.\",\"totalCost\":11650,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":210,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Berserker's Fury\",\"Endless Battle\",\"Malefic Roar\"]},{\"key\":\"critchance\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalChance\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":25,\"sources\":[\"Berserker's Fury\"]},{\"key\":\"critdmg\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalDamage\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Berserker's Fury\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\"]},{\"key\":\"hybridsteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hybridLifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"Endless Battle\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":1050,\"sources\":[\"Endless Battle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"mpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.manaRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Endless Battle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Endless Battle\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Endless Battle\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=freya\u0026items=tough-boots%2Ccorrosion-scythe%2Cberserkers-fury%2Cendless-battle%2Cmalefic-roar%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=inspire\u0026emblem=assassin\u0026talents=fatal%2Cweapon-master%2Cwar-cry\u0026flex=great-dragon-spear.malefic-roar%2Csea-halberd.malefic-roar%2Crose-gold-meteor.immortality\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"jungle-tempo-cleanup\",\"name\":\"Jungle Tempo Cleanup\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"sky-piercer\",\"name\":\"Sky Piercer\",\"cost\":1500,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\",\"cost\":2330,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\"},{\"slug\":\"sky-piercer\",\"name\":\"Sky Piercer\"},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"thrill\",\"name\":\"Thrill\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/thrill.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"seasoned-hunter\",\"name\":\"Seasoned Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/seasoned-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"killing-spree\",\"name\":\"Killing Spree\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/killing-spree.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"retribution\",\"name\":\"Retribution\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"ice-retribution\",\"name\":\"Ice Retribution\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"sky-piercer\",\"name\":\"Sky Piercer\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the early snowball is not secure and you need steadier stats for Turtle and Lord fights.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the main targets already have high Physical Defense and extra range is less important than armor conversion.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"trigger\":\"Use before late Lord fights when one failed dive would give away the map.\"}],\"notes\":\"Jungle Freya build for fast ganks, Ice Retribution chase control, and cleanup pressure after Corrosion Scythe starts sticking targets.\",\"totalCost\":10750,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":210,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Endless Battle\",\"Malefic Gun\",\"Sea Halberd\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Sky Piercer\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":70,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Malefic Gun\",\"Sea Halberd\"]},{\"key\":\"hybridsteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hybridLifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"Endless Battle\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\